# TyrannoPrimeval (22215, its shipped buffs), every draw 0: a hit on it with its top desire target set drops its
# attack desires, remembers that target (c_ai1) and wants its second self buff on itself; the buff finishing in a
# fight sets its chance multiplier (i_ai3) to ProbMultiplier2 (5) and forgets the target, wanting to attack it again
# (100) on top of the 125 the second hit added.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.TyrannoPrimeval.TyrannoPrimeval
npc rex 22215 Monster 300 0 0 skill SELF_BUFF1 5087 1 skill SELF_BUFF2 5087 2 skill LONG_RANGE_DD_MAGIC1 5120 1

stance rex on
hit rex 10
  S MagicSkillUse caster=rex target=rex skill=5087-2 hit=5285 reuse=0 success=0
top rex player
  top rex player
hit rex 10
  mem rex c_ai1=player
advance 6s
  S MagicSkillUse caster=rex target=player skill=5120-1 hit=1321 reuse=7928 success=0
  mem rex i_ai3=5 c_ai1=-
  desires rex attack(player)=225 cast(player,5120,move)=2000000
